            "notes": "\ud83d\udccc Round 1 \ud83d\udccc\n\n\ud83c\udf80 Power : \n- I recommend choosing (it's mandatory) [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) Cuz it's so important to this build, You should try to shoot enemies with low health, such as supports, whenever possible.\n\n\ud83d\udcd5 Playing style : \n- Try to split it into 90% healing for your friends and 10% dealing damage.\n- Play like normal mode, try to heal Tank often, it will give you a lot of money.\n- Try to play as the team's backline. Remember, in the beginning, \"I don't have enough power to kill anyone.\"\n\n\ud83c\udf87 Status :\n- Damage : 110\n- Heal : 75",
