            "notes": "\ud83d\udccc Round 2 \ud83d\udccc\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Item : \n- However, try to buy  [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a) First of all, it's really important and try to stay afloat and shoot all the time.\n- Or if you have enough money, you can swap  [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) with [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) You can do the same by focusing on  [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a) and  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) main\n\n\ud83d\udcd5 Playing style : \n- Okay, now you're dealing quite a bit of damage, try floating in the air to deal some damage.\n\n\ud83c\udf87 Status :\n- Damage On Foot : 115\n- Damage Airborne : 130\n- Heal : 79\n\nWith [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n- Damage On Foot : 128\n- Damage Airborne : 145\n- Heal : 90",
