            "notes": "\ud83d\udccc Round 3 \ud83d\udccc\n\n\ud83c\udf80 Power : \nIn this round, I have two options for you to choose from.\n- Option 1: If your teammates can heal or your team lacks damage, I recommend choosing [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) It will be very useful for survival and can combo with  [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a) while using [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) It's considered to be floating in the air, which makes it quite nice.\n\n- Option 2: If you want to earn more money and help heal your teammates, I recommend choosing  [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) It will help you heal your teammates and boost their speed, giving you even more money.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Item : \n-  Item [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a) It is one of the most important items to deal more damage, so I recommend buying the item. [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) To further increase WP% but if you have 23K, I recommend buying these items. I will rank them in order of importance.\n1.  [Vantage Shot](item_6d7a0598-07cf-45ea-bbf5-c7e7b975e07a) \n2.  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n3.  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) \n4.  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n5.  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \n\n\ud83d\udcd5 Playing style : \n- If selected [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) Try to hold down the Spacebar key at all times while using it.  [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) The reason I chose this Power is because I will have a higher and more effective position to shoot while floating to shoot the easiest enemies to kill.\n\n- If selected [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) Do the same thing, except you'll have less space to choose from. Try to play with your teammates as much as possible. Try to use  [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) Give it to your teammates often, it will give you a lot of money, but don't forget to jump and shoot the enemies.\n\n\ud83c\udf88 More\n- If you have  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) Try using [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) and shoot the enemy immediately, it will deal a lot more damage",
