            "notes": "\ud83d\udccc Round 4 \ud83d\udccc\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Item : \n- Now you need to buy an item. [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) I'm forcing you to buy it right away. It's a must have for this round, but I'm pretty sure you'll have around 30K by the time you have enough. If you have enough money, I'd recommend the following.\n\n For you to sell [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to buy [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) and if you have money left, you can buy survival items during  [Adrenaline Shot](item_ab8eba6a-0bda-4b12-8854-4ba4169b515f) or [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) It's also possible. It depends on your preference.\n\n\ud83d\udcd5 Playing style : \n- In this round, your damage will be very severe. I highly recommend you to use it. [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) Then shoot the enemy immediately. \nThe damage done if you use  [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) It will be at 179 damage based on the attack against [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) that doesn't have Item.\n\n- If you choose [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) don't be sad, it can be done the same way, just change the use. [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) to [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) Just use it, then jump high and shoot like that.",
