            "notes": "\ud83d\udccc Round 5 \ud83d\udccc\n\n\ud83c\udf80 Power : \n- If you didn't choose any Power in the 3rd round, choose that one too.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Item : \n-  In this round you will need to purchase [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) and [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) It is inevitable that if you have extra money, it is recommended to buy additional WP% items such as: [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and if you have enough money, I recommend buying it.  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) that's good. It helps you survive better.\n\n\ud83d\udcd5 Playing style : \n- You're quite strong this time. Try flying by [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) and shoot the important enemies and the enemy team first. If you are about to die, hurry up and use [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) in an instant, it will save you from death.\n\n***most important***\n- Do not use [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) Until I didn't even think about its cooldown.\nI recommend keeping one charge handy for emergencies, and I recommend holding down the Spacebar instead of pressing it. [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) until it's completely charged instead",
